    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/7-parkside-woods-clongriffin-dublin-d13-x63k\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 7 Parkside Woods, Clongriffin, Dublin.\r\n\r\nSituated in the heart of Clongriffin, this attractive five-bedroom terraced residence offers generous and flexible accommodation arranged over three floors. The red-brick façade is complemented by a paved approach and established planting, creating a welcoming entrance to the home.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the ground floor opens into a comfortable living room, where a large front window provides plenty of natural light. To the rear is a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining room featuring contemporary cabinetry, integrated cooking appliances and ample room for dining. Double doors connect this space directly with the rear garden. A separate laundry room and guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, offering flexibility for family living, guests or home-working requirements. Several bedrooms benefit from built-in wardrobes, providing useful storage. A family bathroom on this level includes both a bath and separate shower enclosure, while an additional storage cupboard is positioned off the landing.\r\n\r\nThe second floor is home to a generously sized main bedroom with an ensuite shower room, providing a private space away from the principal accommodation. A further full-sized bedroom with fitted wardrobes is also located on this level. Accessed through a ceiling hatch within this room, the separate attic has been timber-floored to provide a substantial additional storage area.\r\n\r\nOutside, the enclosed east-facing rear garden features a paved patio, lawn, mature trees and established planting. Its orientation allows it to benefit from direct morning sunlight while retaining a bright aspect during the day. A stepping-stone pathway leads to a timber garden shed, providing further outdoor storage.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently located within easy reach of local schools, parks and everyday amenities. Clongriffin train station, nearby bus services and the surrounding road network provide convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nWith five bedrooms, generous living accommodation, extensive storage and a well-established east-facing rear garden, this home offers a practical and versatile layout. Its location and connectivity make it an appealing option for those seeking additional space within a thriving residential community."
      },
